  "description": "Built for riders ready to take the next step, the CRS 18” is a scaled-down progression machine packed with features usually found on much higher-end bikes. A crmo down tube frame, fully sealed Salt cassette hub, lightweight Spanish bottom bracket, and Éclat Surge plastic pedals combine to deliver durability, reliability, and performance where it matters most. With its super-short 11.65” chainstay and responsive geometry, the CRS 18” is designed to help younger riders build confidence, learn new tricks, and progress faster than ever.",
